B.aRK=new A.a(B.a,["Geo-helmintos (Ascaris, Trichuris, ancil\xf3stomo): 400 mg VO dose \xfanica | Estrongiloid\xedase: 400 mg 2\xd7/dia \xd7 3\u20137 dias | Neurocisticercose: 15 mg/kg/dia \xf7 2 doses \xd7 8\u201330 dias (\xb1 dexametasona) | Equinococose: 400 mg 2\xd7/dia em ciclos | Larva migrans: 400 mg/dia \xd7 3\u20135 dias | Pedi\xe1trico > 2 anos: mesma dose do adulto","Geohelmintos (Ascaris, Trichuris, anquilostoma): 400 mg VO dosis \xfanica | Estrongiloidiasis: 400 mg 2\xd7/d\xeda \xd7 3\u20137 d\xedas | Neurocisticercosis: 15 mg/kg/d\xeda \xf7 2 dosis \xd7 8\u201330 d\xedas (\xb1 dexametasona) | Equinococosis: 400 mg 2\xd7/d\xeda en ciclos | Larva migrans: 400 mg/d\xeda \xd7 3\u20135 d\xedas | Pedi\xe1trico > 2 a\xf1os: misma dosis del adulto"],t.w)
